@host = http://localhost:5080

### List available providers
GET {{host}}/api/providers

### Search albums on Deezer (real API)
GET {{host}}/api/albums/search?q=daft%20punk&provider=deezer&limit=5

### Search albums on Spotify (fake provider)
GET {{host}}/api/albums/search?q=radiohead&provider=spotify

### Search with default provider (deezer)
GET {{host}}/api/albums/search?q=radiohead

### Get album details from Deezer
GET {{host}}/api/albums/deezer/302127

### Save an album to a user's library (creates the user on first save)
POST {{host}}/api/users/alice/library
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "deezer",
  "providerAlbumId": "302127"
}

### Get a user's library
GET {{host}}/api/users/alice/library

### Remove an album from a user's library (replace with a real id)
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/alice/library/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Unknown provider -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/albums/search?q=test&provider=napster

### Album unknown to the provider -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/users/alice/library
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "deezer",
  "providerAlbumId": "999999999999"
}

### Duplicate save -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/users/alice/library
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "deezer",
  "providerAlbumId": "302127"
}
